[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3702268909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114342#issuecomment-3702268909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114342","id":3702268909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7crCPt","user":{"login":"jchrom","id":7213168,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMTMxNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7213168?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom","html_url":"https://github.com/jchrom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchrom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-31T14:06:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-31T14:10:41Z","body":"Possibly related.\n\nI have the following resource class:\n```gdscript\nclass_name TestRes extends Resource\n@export var val: int\n@export var arr: Array[int]\n```\nI create two instances, `\"a.tres\"` and `\"b.tres\"`. I then run the following:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nclass_name Tool extends Resource\n\n@export_tool_button(\"Run\") var run_button: Callable = run\n\nfunc run() -> void:\n\tvar a: TestRes = ResourceLoader.load(\"a.tres\", \"TestRes\")\n\tvar b: TestRes = ResourceLoader.load(\"b.tres\", \"TestRes\")\n\t\n\ta.val = 1\n\ta.arr.append(1)\n\t\n\tResourceSaver.save(a, \"a.tres\")\n\tResourceSaver.save(b, \"b.tres\")\n```\nAfter this operation:\n\n- Both `a.arr` and `b.arr` are [1] in the inspector (should only be `a.arr` no?).\n- But the value is not present in the .tres file (for any of the two).\n- OTOH `a.val` shows a value of 1 in the inspector and in the a.tres, and `b.val` remains 0 (as expected).\n- Reloading the project resets both `a.arr` and `b.arr` to empty arrays (but the `a.val` value persists).\n\nNote: Adding `@tool` annotation to `TestRes` resolves the issue. With it in place, only `a.arr` gets appended and not `b.arr`, and the value persists through project reload.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3702268909/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3702321658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114342#issuecomment-3702321658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114342","id":3702321658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7crPH6","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-31T14:41:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-31T14:41:46Z","body":"This also happens to default values of dictionaries. Probably the same underlying reason https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107588#issuecomment-3532316070","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3702321658/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5422571900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114342#issuecomment-5422571900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114342","id":5422571900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQzXhfA","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T08:20:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T08:20:11Z","body":"Stumbled upon this issue while writing an editor plugin on v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]. For example if you had anything in an exported array and then reset it using the reset button in the inspector, the array becomes readonly and the plugin cannot modify it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5422571900/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]